# Who must approve a change, by path. A pull request that touches any path
# below needs @kaliperdev's approval before it can merge (the ruleset on main
# asks for code owner review).
#
# Not listed, so not owned: agents/ (catalog entries, their guides and
# screenshots) and published/ (records of what was published). A pull request
# that changes only those merges on green checks: CI validates every entry,
# guide and screenshot (tests/), and nothing that runs today changes when an
# agent is added. How to add one: docs/adding-an-agent.md.

# The catalog: its format, checks, store and service.
/marketplace/            @kaliperdev
/db/                     @kaliperdev
/pyproject.toml          @kaliperdev
/uv.lock                 @kaliperdev
/Dockerfile              @kaliperdev
/docker-compose.yml      @kaliperdev

# What CI checks: a weaker test would let a bad entry through.
/tests/                  @kaliperdev

# How it is built, published and hosted.
/deploy/                 @kaliperdev
/.github/                @kaliperdev

# The rules everyone works by.
/docs/                   @kaliperdev
/README.md               @kaliperdev
